Unity e faça upload/download do Steam Workshop! <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/570950/extras/34c8fcb7101e4a9c58122cc02307913a.poster.avif?t=1779870143\" width=496 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/570950/extras/34c8fcb7101e4a9c58122cc02307913a.webm?t=1779870143\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/570950/extras/34c8fcb7101e4a9c58122cc02307913a.mp4?t=1779870143\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <br><strong>Sobre o desenvolvedor: </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >O Devilated foi criado por <strong>Trunka </strong>- um artista 3D - responsável pela arte, pelo código, e design. Trilha sonora de <strong>Sigurd Jøhnk-Jensen</strong>.</p>",
